    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d267">

                <pb facs="0380" n="260" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg260"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Snyder to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-11-07"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">November 7, 1905</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 93.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inform you that I have
                    settled the claim of Raymond and Sophie Smith, American citizens, for damages
                    suffered at the hands of government troops during the last revolution, for the
                    sum of $1,500 gold, payable in <hi rendition="#italic">vales de
                        extranjeros.</hi> * * *</p>
                <p>I inclose herewith copy and translation of the resolution of the Colombian
                    foreign office settling this claim.</p>
                <p>It might be well to remark that this is the only claim to date in which the
                    Colombian Government has paid the full amount requested, even in <hi
                        rendition="#italic">vales.</hi></p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alban G. Snyder.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d267-a1.xml" xpointer="d267-a1"/>
            </div>
